 {"date_iso":"1688-06-25","date_display":"25 June 1688","eye":"mergui-officer","claim":"The Siamese soldiers under French command turn on their officer as the revolution reaches Mergui","form":"diary","evidence":"A Full and True Relation… (London, c.1689–90), appended diary","confidence":"verified"},
